      <title>uutils Coreutils 0.11 版兼容率升至 95.33%，PGO 后性能最高提升 31%</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260901/uutils-Coreutils-0.11-%E7%89%88%E5%85%BC%E5%AE%B9%E7%8E%87%E5%8D%87%E8%87%B3-95.33PGO-%E5%90%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-31/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
